  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 601.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "1990-11-07",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 601.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this chapter is to specify the procedures to be followed when proposing to remove a dam under the auspices of the department’s river restoration program and the criteria that will be applied in reviewing such proposals.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84, EXPIRED 11-7-90\n\nNew. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
